{"data":[{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2023-11-25T03:51:53.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1728260191710564753"],"id":"1728260191710564753","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":7,"impression_count":37488,"like_count":18,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":2},"text":"刚刚有会员问我大阪有啥可玩的，在东京待久了，突然发现自己对其他地方玩的地方好像好久没有关注了。\n飞田新地应该是每个去大阪的人最容易接触到的，但那服务确实是一年不如一年，听说现在全部都戴套口了？\n泡泡浴大阪没有，想去要去神户福原或滋贺雄琴，但能接外国人的也不多，能接的质量都可差了。","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1728260191710564753"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2023-11-24T18:07:05.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1728113021573308621"],"id":"1728113021573308621","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":31393,"like_count":5,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"1727806243962544307","type":"quoted"}],"text":"国足这就在这个时候不会输... https://t.co/PRETxpf60t","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1728113021573308621"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2023-11-24T18:04:39.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1728112406252122237"],"id":"1728112406252122237","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":4,"impression_count":30323,"like_count":6,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":1},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"1727887820034035746","type":"quoted"}],"text":"老杨这腿抖得像傻逼一样 https://t.co/Pm0tU7eUyb","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1728112406252122237"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2023-11-24T02:46:50.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1727881432457220182"],"id":"1727881432457220182","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":5,"impression_count":26146,"like_count":27,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":7,"retweet_count":0},"text":"有个人带了个乍富的老板就跑过来跟我说是不差钱的客人。一听就知道是什么层次，就随手扔给我下面的一个经纪去安排，我也没有过多理会。\n今天经纪跑过来跟我说，就属于那种没钱还装逼的，目中无人，花最少的钱，吹最大的牛逼。问我还咋办...我说他要装就配合他装好，收钱时候能宰就宰。","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1727881432457220182"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2023-11-23T03:48:27.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1727534549796848094"],"id":"1727534549796848094","public_metrics":{"